&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;Install, and permanently maintain, two ‘swift brick‘ nesting boxes within
the fabric of the new upper storey side wall at or above roof eaves level on
the eastern aspect of the building. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;b.&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;Either&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;After the removal of soot and other loose materials from its interior,
reducing and capping off the chimney on the eastern aspect of the building in
accordance with the otherwise approved plans, the applicant shall provide the
means for bats of small to medium size to access the chimney cavity for the
purposes of winter hibernation. A suitable weather shielded entrance, of
appropriate dimensions should be provided on the eastern face of the chimney at
0.1-0.5 metres below the level of the existing window ledge;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
